  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "个人剧情 梅尔"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Rhodes Island Landship\n'Lutra Workshop'"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Ooh, looks like it's about time. Gotta get to work now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Lemme see the schedule for today.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Mmm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Mmyeah, works for me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Let's get around to Maggy's 'Improvement proposals for Drone Dragonfly operation' and polish off my submissions for today. Get around to the rest later. Then I just gotta wait for her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Doing maintenance on Saria's armor? Main thing should be giving it a new coat of paint... crap, did I not order paint?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Arghh—we're good, we're good. Didn't use it up last time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Main focus for today'll be that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "If I get the time, I'll send some orders for a couple new parts. Then I can give all my frontline Meeboos some real maintenance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Mm-hm. Today's lineup, sorted.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Let's kick it off!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Mayer!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Mayer, open the door!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "It's urgent!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Not too happy about Saria's suit here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Wonder why it can't charge up properly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Weird. C'mon, where's the problem, officer?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Mayer! I know you're in there!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "I hear you talking!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Rooound here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Ah-hah~ Gotcha.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Prime suspect found. We're on Easy Street now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Don't make me do it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Just need to restore a failed node, and the whole suit should be back up and working again.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Uh-huh. Optimize charge circuits first. Paint over next. You'll be back to regular service in no time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "D'you want some extra features while I'm at it? Hmm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//（开门的音效）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Ugh. I don't know if Kal'tsit's gonna chew me out for abusing privileges...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Who cares. Your fault for acting deaf, Mayer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Mayer!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Settled.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Check over your nodes one more time. Gonna be a pain once the paint gets all in you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Working with earphones in? Aren't you worried someone's gonna spook you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Mmm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Hm-hmm—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "(Claps Mayer's shoulder)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "(Opens mouth and bites)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Waaagghahagh!!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Ow, ow!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Let go of me, damnit, let go of me!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "I'm a BAD meal!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "You really blew it, Mayer. I had something good for you, and you wouldn't even open the door for me. Plus, you bit me...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Sorry, Closure. But, like, you know I bite when someone interrupts my work.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Owwieeee.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Fine, I'll let you bite me too, then. Fair's fair?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "You're applying anti-Originium paint to a suit right now, I see?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Sure am.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Pass, then. I bite you here and one moment later I'll be in Medical. Not worth it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Eh, I guess you're not wrong.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Mmm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Closure?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "What's up?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "The door's stuck open.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "I specifically remember setting it up to automatically open and close. Pretty sure I also set it a moment ago to 'do not disturb.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Did you just hack my door?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Uhh—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "No way~~ It was like that when I walked in.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Your door just wasn't locked.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Didn't I lock it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "...Weird.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Can you gimme a moment? I'll check the tapes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "You put a camera up?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "I got a lotta sensitive Rhine material in here, y'know? It'd be bad news for all of us if I lost something.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Gotta take basic security measures.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Nah, you should get back to work for now...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "R—Remember your health and safety regs. This paint's, uh, pretty dangerous, yeah? Things could go wrong with you trying to multitask!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "It's fine, I've got mechanical arms on it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Hmm, which program was it again?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Er, Mayer, don't you think this paint's gonna go volatile soon?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "That paint? It's fine, sheesh. It's inert.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "You could dump it in boiling water and ionize it for three hours, freeze it, and it'd still be good to go the moment it thaws.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Is this the folder?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "OK, monitor program, on.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Time seek to—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Mayer!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Let's make smart robots together!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Mayer?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "——!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "M—Mayer?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "What did you just say?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Could—Could you repeat that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Make some smart robots with me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Sure!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Then let's work specifics somewh—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "(Presses monitor feed transmission toggle)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Bzzzz—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monitor Feed",
      "text": "(Sound of door opening)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monitor Feed",
      "text": "Ugh. I don't know if Kal'tsit's gonna chew me out for abusing privileges...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monitor Feed",
      "text": "Who cares. Your fault for acting deaf, Mayer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Meeboos.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Get her ass.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meeboos",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "AaaaghhI'msorryit'smyfault don't sic the Meeboos on me ow ow ow ow waaaghhhhh!!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Yeah, go on. What was it you wanted me for?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Uwaaahh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "I wanted you to help me with an explosive-type thingy...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Underlying machine's a Raythean Challenger Hellcat high-performance operation platform...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Topside already has a custom-ordered full-thermal Arts impact generator...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "But it's not working a hundred percent perfect, so I need your help...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Uwaaahh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Yeah, okay.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Just take a sniff of this first.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Okaaaayhhh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "(Inhale)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "I know this!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "(Takes a deep breath)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "You better now?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Hahhhh~~~~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Better!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Eheheheh. Thanks, Mayer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "We're not gonna get any business done with you bawling your eyes out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "True that, heheh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Still dunno why you love sniffing the refined lubricant I have in here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Well, 'cause it smells good, duh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Guess Warfarin wasn't wrong. There's no blood in your veins, just machine oil.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Enough of that. Let's get real.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Aye-aye.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "You need me to refit the Raythean Challenger. Raise its attack power. Right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Also, self-defense, damage resist, and evac plans. After all, we're gonna put a smart little guy in there. Can't have it breaking after one use.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Then you came to the right person.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Now. My reward?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Remember how there was a little hoard in the hangar? As long as you—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "I'll take the job!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Heheh. Let's get along, partner.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Gettin' along, gettin' along~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "But, uh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "What?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "See the blackboard over there?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Covered in sticky notes?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "That's my schedule.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Even if as a rush job, your commission still lands bottom-right of the very last note.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Uhh—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Any way I can jump the queue?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "No, sirree.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "So in other words, two months.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Work fast, it'll be fifty days.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Do you really work that fast?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Decently. Sometimes inspiration hits and the work's done.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Er... I'll leave you to it, then...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Good luck with work!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Hold it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "You format the door for me first. I need to do its settings over.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Also, strip your sys-op authority off it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Right now. Straight away. Giddy up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Uhh—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Awright...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two hours later..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Just the laaast bit—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ding dong!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Mayer, it's me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Um...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Did you change the password? Is that why the door's not opening?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "And that should be about done.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Huh? Someone at the door again?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "It's me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Maggy! The door's broken! Push the button on the side and come in!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Hi, you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Heyo.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "I'm still busy with something for Saria here. Can't lay out the carpet for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "So, you need something from me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "I made a reservation.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Drone plans. Wondering how they're doing?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Huh... oh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "That. Already done.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Listed out some technical essentials, improvement proposals and required materials. Everything's in that file on the table there. You look through, and if it's all good, we can set up a new time to help you make some fitting parts.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "If you've got issues with it, we'll have a meeting about it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Rightie. Thanks, Mayer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Which file on which table is it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "That one, that one.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Your mechanical arms are pointing at at least four different tables. How should I know which one?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Mayeeer—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Ahhh don't pull me! I'm still painting here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "You can leave paint and keep painting later. Help me find the files first, okay?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Mayeeeer~~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "I get it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Mm-hm. Thankies~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Mmn—it's this one.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Oh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "These are your expensed items for last month.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Oh, sorry. I meant this one.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Mmm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Yep, that's it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Thank you, Mayer!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Ain't no thang. Just what I oughta do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Then I'll be heading out now. Bye-bye.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Ah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "I almost forgot the most important part!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Can I ask you what the time is right now?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Noon, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Afternoon already!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Mayer, have you eaten yet?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Huh? You mean me? I eat an energy bar and I'm fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "That's no good!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Here, take this!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "This is?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "I bought it at the cafeteria. They had the freshwater stuff you love today.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "I wanted you to come eat with me, but then I lost track of time myself...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "So after I finished eating, I got a portion bagged up to bring over.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Ooh, thanks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Make sure you eat it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Mm-hm, I will.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Anything else?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Is this Saria's Charged Suit?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "That it is.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "How much longer will you be working?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "An hour or two-ish.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Well, that's no good. Let me help you out there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "It's fine, I can do it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Either you let me help you, or I feed you your meal. Pick one.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Ugh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Alright fine I get it! Give me a hand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Hehe~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Then let's get to work~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Phew. We're done.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Good work.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "C'mere and wash your hands.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Alright—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "*Sigh*... It's only times like these I miss all of Rhine's self-cleaning facilities.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "So why don't you go back?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "If I went back, they'd set me up with a mountain of annoying work, and I'd have no time to improve my Meeboos.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "And, like, I had to deal with interpersonal stuff there too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Like you don't have to here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "You're always out on fieldwork. You don't know all the politics and warring between sections.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Over there, right? You'd make a new friend one day, turn around, and bam, someone tells you 'they're from the blah-blah section, best you stay away from them.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "And what's worse is even if you're in the same section, sometimes your bosses are competing and you're all trying to drag each other down.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "That's stuff I'm, like, just not good at dealing with.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "So I ended up scarpering here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "I see...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Sorry, I shouldn't have asked you about...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "It's okay...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Alright, let's eat.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Then I should be on my way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Meeboos, can I ask you to keep an eye on her? Otherwise she'll go straight back to work the moment I'm gone.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "My Meeboos don't have voice modules. They won't answer you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "I still have to nag you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magallan",
      "text": "Okay then. This time I'm really off. Bye-bye.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Bye bye.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Hmm, maybe I should put those part orders through before I eat—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Whuah! What the hell are you doing, Meeboos?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meeboos",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "It's just a little bit of work. I'm not gonna forget to eat.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meeboos",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Ugh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Fine, I get it, I'm eating, I'm eating now!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Phew, I'm stuffed. Alright, work!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Mmm, order parts first or fix some Meeboos first?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meeboos",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Meeboos win out, yeah. Meeboos are more important.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "C'mere.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meeboos",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Lemme see—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Touch up paint, inspect wiring, update data, replenish energy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "That's what Meeboo maintenance is made of...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Better!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Still four more on mission duty, and my five reserve ones need servicing too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "What time is it, again?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Looks like I can get 'em done today.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Mmm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Probably. Probably can.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "As long as nobody else—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Mayer! Open up!! Work needs you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "——————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Oh, c'mon, for fffff~!@~#!@...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "*Huff*, *huff*.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Stay cool.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "In—out, in—out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Smile~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Alright.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Whoa, so you're in.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "What's got you all smiles and rainbows?",
